---
source: crates/sb/tests/docker_control.rs
expression: "help(&[\"docker\", \"restart\", \"--help\"])"
---
  Restart Docker containers managed by Saltbox in dependency order.

  USAGE

    sb docker restart [--flags]

  FLAGS

    --color    Controls when to use color (auto)
    -h --help  Help for restart
    --ignore   Containers to ignore during restart operation (can be specified multiple times)
